<title>BULGARIA: Bulgarian airport reopens after fog clears.</title>
<headline>Bulgarian airport reopens after fog clears.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Sofia airport reopened on Monday afternoon after dense fog which had kept it closed on Sunday and Monday morning cleared, an airport official said.</p>
<p>Local carrier Balkan Airlines had diverted its flights to Bourgas on the Black Sea coast, and foreign airlines had cancelled flights because they were unable to land.</p>
</text>
